-* a set `W` of finite subsets of a type `ι` of hyperplanes,
-* containing the base vertex `∅`,
-* closed under the majority operation `medFinset A B C = (A ∩ B) ∪ (B ∩ C) ∪ (A ∩ C)`.
-
